# Testscript fixtures are read as bytes: a script's embedded files ("-- notes.txt --")
# are compared by size and content in a few places, and a Windows checkout that
# converted LF to CRLF changed those bytes (a 15-byte file arrived as 16). Marking
# them verbatim keeps a fixture identical on every platform, which is also what a
# golden file would need.
*.txtar -text
